-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface transition-colors font-label-md text-label-md rounded-lg" data-path="track-case" href="#">پیگیری پرونده</a><a class="px-3 py-2 text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface transition-colors font-label-md text-label-md rounded-lg" data-path="about" href="#">درباره ما</a></nav></div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm"><a class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-tertiary-container hover:bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(173,97,38,0.25)] transition-colors" data-path="treatment-cart" href="#">شروع مشاوره و برآورد رایگان</a><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-[18px]">person</span></div></div></div></header><main class="w-full pt-[120px] bg-background min-h-screen"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
